---
// About Component
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header page-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        <span class="section-number">02.</span>
        <span class="section-text">About Me</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="bio-section">
      <div class="bio-content">
        <h2>My Background</h2>
        <p>
          I am a systems architect and engineer driven by solving complex, multi-layered problems. Instead of just writing code, I focus on bridging the gap between hardware, software, and cloud infrastructure to architect resilient, end-to-end solutions.
        </p>
        <p>
          As the <strong>CTO and Embedded Systems Engineer</strong> at <strong>Code & Circuits</strong>, I translate real-world challenges into automated, hardware-backed IoT solutions using precision sensors and microcontrollers. Simultaneously, as a <strong>DevOps Engineer</strong> at <strong>Zone01 Kisumu</strong>, I solve infrastructure bottlenecks—designing scalable, zero-downtime deployment pipelines utilizing AWS, Terraform, Docker, and Kubernetes to keep operations running effortlessly.
        </p>
        <p>
          Previously, as a <strong>DevOps Engineer</strong> at <a href="https://www.chichwa.ke/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-link">Chichwa</a> (in partnership with UNDP), I helped secure and scale a digital agricultural marketplace that directly solved logistical challenges for farmers, cooperatives, and buyers across Kenya.
        </p>
        <p>
          My technical stack spans Go, Rust, JavaScript, Python, and C++. Because I am deeply comfortable operating anywhere from low-level embedded constraints to high-availability cloud environments, I can identify root-cause issues quickly and eliminate single points of failure across the entire software lifecycle.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether it’s optimizing cloud latency or automating physical hardware, I build systems that simply work—delivering sustainable, highly secure, and deeply optimized results.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bio-image">
        <div class="video-window">
          <div class="window-header">
            <div class="window-controls">
              <span class="control-dot red"></span>
              <span class="control-dot yellow"></span>
              <span class="control-dot green"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="window-title">root@system:~# whoami</div>
          </div>
          <div class="video-content">
            <img src="/assets/about-me.jpg" alt="Professional photo" />
          </div>
          <div class="video-controls">
            <button class="control-btn" aria-label="Control 1">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M23 7l-7 5 7 5V7z"></path>
                <rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <button class="control-btn" aria-label="Control 2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path>
                <path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"></path>
                <line x1="12" y1="19" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
                <line x1="8" y1="23" x2="16" y2="23"></line>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <button class="control-btn hangup" aria-label="End">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
              </svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="skills-section">
      <h2>Skills & Expertise</h2>

      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div class="skill-category">
          <div class="category-header">
            <span class="category-icon">⚡</span>
            <h3>Embedded Systems & IoT</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-tags">
            <span class="skill-tag">Arduino / C++</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Raspberry Pi</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">MQTT & Serial</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-category">
          <div class="category-header">
            <span class="category-icon">💻</span>
            <h3>Software Engineering</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-tags">
            <span class="skill-tag">Go</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">JavaScript & TS</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Rust</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-category">
          <div class="category-header">
            <span class="category-icon">☁️</span>
            <h3>DevOps & Cloud</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-tags">
            <span class="skill-tag">Docker & K8s</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">AWS</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Terraform</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">CI/CD Pipelines</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* About Section */
  .about {
    padding: 100px 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--light-navy);
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Feather gradient to Projects section */
  .about::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 15vh;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, #000000);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  /* Page Header */
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .section-title {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 45px);
    font-weight: 800;
    position: relative;
    white-space: nowrap;
    margin: 0 0 40px 0;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue) 0%, var(--green) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .section-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--green);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 20px);
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .section-text::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    width: 150px;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: var(--green);
    margin: 15px auto 0 auto;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  /* Bio Section */
  .bio-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .bio-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--white) 0%, var(--blue) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .bio-content h2:after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -8px;
    left: 0;
    width: 40px;
    height: 3px;
    background-color: var(--green);
  }

  .bio-content p {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .inline-link {
    color: var(--green);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--green);
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .inline-link:hover {
    border-bottom-style: solid;
    color: var(--pink);
    border-bottom-color: var(--pink);
  }

  .bio-image {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* Video Window Styling */
  .video-window {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 350px;
    background-color: #0a192f;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--green);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.1), inset 0 0 10px rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.05);
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .video-window:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 5px 30px rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.2);
  }

  .window-header {
    background-color: var(--lightest-navy);
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--green);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .window-controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .control-dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: block;
  }

  .control-dot.red { background-color: #ff5f57; }
  .control-dot.yellow { background-color: #febc2e; }
  .control-dot.green { background-color: #28c840; }

  .window-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--green);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .video-content {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #0d1b2a;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--green);
  }

  .video-content img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(20%) contrast(110%);
    transition: var(--transition);
  }
  
  .video-window:hover .video-content img {
    filter: none;
  }

  .video-controls {
    background-color: var(--lightest-navy);
    padding: 12px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .control-btn {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--slate);
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--light-slate);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .control-btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--green-tint);
    border-color: var(--green);
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .control-btn.hangup {
    color: #ff5f57;
    border-color: #ff5f57;
  }

  .control-btn.hangup:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 95, 87, 0.1);
  }

  /* Skills Section */
  .skills-section {
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  .skills-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--white) 0%, var(--blue) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .skills-section h2:after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -8px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 60px;
    height: 3px;
    background-color: var(--green);
  }

  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  /* Skill Categories */
  .skill-category {
    background-color: var(--light-navy);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--lightest-navy);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }
  
  .skill-category::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 4px;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: var(--green);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .skill-category:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: var(--green);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -15px var(--navy-shadow);
  }
  
  .skill-category:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .category-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .category-icon {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-right: 0.75rem;
  }

  .skill-category h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--lightest-slate);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Skill Tags */
  .skill-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .skill-tag {
    color: var(--light-slate);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    background-color: var(--navy);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--lightest-navy);
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .skill-tag::before {
    content: '>';
    color: var(--green);
    margin-right: 6px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .skill-tag:hover {
    border-color: var(--green);
    color: var(--green);
    background-color: rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.05);
  }

  /* Responsive Design */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .bio-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .bio-image {
      order: -1;
    }

    .video-window {
      max-width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }

    .bio-content p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
